5
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:09,600
Who are you?

6
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,560
All the merits I have accumulated,

7
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:19,620
I dedicate to Master Bulan.

8
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:23,360
May you protect her and keep her safe

9
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,180
