to maim you with the dark arts.

24
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,960
Ever since the day I met you,

25
00:01:11,540 --> 00:01:13,900
Krating has been using the dark arts

26
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:16,120
to set vengeful spirits upon you.

27
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:21,840
Huh?

28
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:23,240
On...

29
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,360
