32
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:35,960
I am worried.

33
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,200
Alright.

34
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,280
Before...

35
00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:44,840
I decided to travel here,

36
00:01:45,260 --> 00:01:48,780
I also went through hell.

37
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Now that I know this...

38
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:03,040
I guess I have to reward you
for rescuing me, my beloved.

39
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:20,320
I would have you tread softly.

40
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,480
Your foe

41
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:23,920
