against you next, I know not.

46
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:34,800
Do you understand?

47
00:02:35,740 --> 00:02:36,860
Yes.

48
00:02:37,540 --> 00:02:39,280
I understand.

49
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,500
From now on,

50
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:43,320
I'll be careful,

51
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,370
