worried about me like this again.

53
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:16,500
Hello, Sarge?

54
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,160
What did you say?

55
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,780
Of course, Sarge.

56
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,680
I'm on my way to the station.

57
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,440
