Never.

78
00:05:31,340 --> 00:05:34,300
I only just found out that she has one.

79
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,940
She never told us anything.

80
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:38,120
I just left a comment on the TikTok video

81
00:05:38,140 --> 00:05:40,140
