89
00:06:05,540 --> 00:06:07,380
I will allow you two

90
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:09,480
to deploy our officers alongside

91
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:12,640
the officers
from Mae Sot Police Station.

92
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:14,660
But this time,

93
00:06:15,140 --> 00:06:17,360
besides rescuing the victims,

94
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:20,200
