95
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:35,010
This is a joint operation between

96
00:06:35,020 --> 00:06:36,900
Mae Sot Police Station
and Phop Phra Police Station

97
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:38,480
for this mission.
[Mae Sot Provincial Police Station]

98
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:39,840
Everyone, please be seated.

99
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:43,920
Let's get started.

100
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:52,520
Sarge.

101
00:06:55,020 --> 00:06:56,200
Not there, Sarge.

102
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:59,820
I saw a yantra tattooed on Krating's body

103
