106
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:07,320
Krating's is a decapitated Saming tiger,

107
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:09,140
while the inspector's...

108
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:11,680
is a normal one.

109
00:07:12,060 --> 00:07:13,640
How are these two yantras

110
00:07:13,860 --> 00:07:15,160
different?

111
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,940
The decapitated tiger

112
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:19,480
comes from
the Invulnerable Warrior Sanctum.

113
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:20,780
It is a stratagem

114
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,620
for overcoming fear,

115
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:23,980
so one may become courageous

116
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,400
and fear none.

117
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,560
Have you seen the person in this photo?

118
00:07:30,190 --> 00:07:31,040
Never.

119
00:07:42,980 --> 00:07:44,860
I'm looking for my friend.
[Another missing person in Phop Phra?]

120
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:45,940
Her name is Faii.
[Definitely kidnapped]

121
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:48,000
- Oh, no, I've never seen this one.
- Sarge.

122
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:52,460
My friend went missing.

123
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:54,720
Here, this is what she looks like.

124
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:23,660
If I do this,

125
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:26,320
