come across Krating's clues?

126
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:29,400
Steady your mind.

127
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:31,120
Ponder every detail,

128
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:33,540
whether it seems too difficult

129
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,880
or too simple.

130
00:08:36,300 --> 00:08:37,960
Nothing happens by coincidence.

131
00:09:14,580 --> 00:09:15,640
I now know

132
00:09:16,940 --> 00:09:19,800
where I can search for his clues.

133
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:22,200
- Thank you.
- Wait, my dearest.

134
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,800
This knife is of purity,

135
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:35,120
