auspicious glyphs and incantations.

136
00:09:35,620 --> 00:09:37,580
I have carved your name upon it

137
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:39,240
so that you may claim it as your own.

138
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,440
Were any spirits to brush against it,

139
00:09:42,040 --> 00:09:43,700
