151
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:22,160
My sweetheart?

152
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,260
We need to talk, Seua.

153
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,340
Tell me Krating's whereabouts.

154
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:34,800
Jeez, Officer.

155
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:37,080
