156
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:39,600
I haven't been in contact with him
for a long time,

157
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:42,340
so how would I know where he's hiding

158
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,380
or who he's hiding out with?

159
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:45,680
I don't believe
you haven't got a clue, Seua.

160
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,480
You were friends with him before, no?

161
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,800
Well, I don't know a thing.

162
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,300
And even if I did,

163
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,480
I wouldn't wanna
be caught up in this mess.

164
00:10:55,220 --> 00:10:56,340
Last time,

165
00:10:56,700 --> 00:10:58,520
some fucking shit possessed me

166
00:10:58,900 --> 00:11:00,260
and made me run out in front of a car.

167
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:01,520
I almost died.

168
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:03,480
I'm out.

169
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:06,120
Go search for clues elsewhere, Officer.

170
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:15,840
