172
00:11:20,780 --> 00:11:23,120
I think you two are closer than you let on.

173
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:33,800
Hello, Sarge.

174
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:36,900
A row of five abandoned
three-story shophouses

175
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:37,900
located along a minor road

176
00:11:37,910 --> 00:11:40,060
branching off Highway 12,

177
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:42,180
