178
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:43,840
I've already sent you the coordinates.

179
00:11:43,860 --> 00:11:46,080
Please liaise with Inspector Chon.

180
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:48,400
See you in less than three hours.

181
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:07,720
- Let's go.
- Yes.

182
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:08,940
- Sarge.
- Go.

183
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:09,640
Yes.

184
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:25,080
Stop!

185
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,400
Hands up!

186
00:12:30,460 --> 00:12:31,280
On the ground!

187
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:33,280
Do not move!

188
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:34,720
Hands behind your back.

189
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:36,480
- Behind your back!
- Hands behind your back.

190
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:40,920
Where are the girls?!

191
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:43,320
I... I don't know.

192
00:12:43,340 --> 00:12:44,840
I don't know where the girls are.

193
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,020
Where are they?!

194
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:48,400
I really don't know.
I just got here from home.

195
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,300
Tell us

196
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,280
where the girls are.

197
00:12:51,520 --> 00:12:52,840
I really don't know.

198
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,440
Are those the only words you know?!

199
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,080
Where are they?!

200
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:41,440
Faii.

201
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:44,660
Faii...

202
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:47,640
Are you okay, Faii?

203
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:49,280
Faii.

204
00:13:50,160 --> 00:13:51,040
Faii!

205
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,940
Pull yourself together, Faii.

206
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:59,280
Sarge, I found the...

207
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:45,520
Sarge,

208
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,540
