209
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:49,040
I found Faii and the other girls.

210
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:51,440
I'll leave it to you, Sarge.

211
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:38,240
Where is Krating?

212
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:36,000
Inspector, watch out!

213
00:16:41,270 --> 00:16:44,320
How many bullets
do you have left, Officer?

214
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:49,560
You scum!

215
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:52,360
This will be the fucking death of you!

216
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:55,800
You're the one who'll fucking die.

217
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:10,240
(Incanting)

218
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:14,960
(Incanting)

219
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:19,640
(Incanting)

220
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:44,560
Mommy, I cannot go in to help Mom.

221
00:17:45,380 --> 00:17:48,080
I suppose they no longer
relish the thought of living,

222
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:52,080
