laid hands upon my woman.

223
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:14,880
(Incanting)

224
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:46,880
Lieutenant.

225
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:47,780
Lieutenant...

226
00:19:47,800 --> 00:19:48,640
No, no.

227
00:19:49,280 --> 00:19:50,160
I give up.

228
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:51,640
I give up.

229
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:54,040
You do know

230
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:57,640
how long I've been
waiting for this day, right?

231
00:19:58,060 --> 00:19:59,440
Fucking capture me, then!

232
00:20:03,930 --> 00:20:05,360
I'm already giving up.

233
00:20:07,840 --> 00:20:10,360
What about the victims
who begged you for their lives?

234
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:12,880
Have you ever
given them a fucking chance?!

235
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:15,040
Just capture me, then,
you fucking bastard!

236
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:17,440
What else do you fucking want from me?!

237
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:22,160
Only death

238
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:25,120
will serve a piece of fucking scum
like you right.

239
00:20:31,840 --> 00:20:33,120
From this day forth,

240
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:36,160
