for excessive force.

247
00:21:08,320 --> 00:21:09,520
I don't care.

248
00:21:13,200 --> 00:21:16,000
I'm here because I want to capture him.

249
00:21:17,580 --> 00:21:20,160
If I don't kill him with my own hands,

250
00:21:26,520 --> 00:21:28,800
