264
00:22:04,900 --> 00:22:06,160
Let the guy live.

265
00:22:07,360 --> 00:22:09,000
Let him pay for what he's done.

266
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:12,400
This is not Lieutenant Peem,

267
00:22:14,100 --> 00:22:15,380
not their older sister,

268
00:22:17,120 --> 00:22:18,120
and not...

269
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,160
